---
// Footer.astro - Brand Navigation & Legal Information
---

<footer class="w-full border-t border-white/[0.08] bg-[#0A0A0A] text-neutral-400 py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <!-- Top Footer Brand Bar -->
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-start md:items-center justify-between gap-6 pb-12 border-b border-white/[0.06]">
      <div>
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="font-bold tracking-[0.22em] text-white text-xl">FUJIFILM</span>
          <span class="h-4 w-[1px] bg-white/20"></span>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono tracking-widest text-[#A3A3A3] uppercase">X100VI</span>
        </div>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400 font-light mt-2 max-w-sm">
          El arte de ver el mundo. Sensor X-Trans CMOS 5 HR de 40.2 MP y estabilización de imagen de 5 ejes integrada.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
        <a
          href="#preorder"
          class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold tracking-wider text-black bg-white hover:bg-neutral-100 hover:shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] transition-all cursor-pointer"
        >
          Pre-order ($1,599 USD)
        </a>
        <a
          href="#overview"
          class="px-4 py-2.5 rounded-full text-xs font-mono tracking-wider text-neutral-300 border border-white/10 hover:border-white/20 hover:text-white transition-colors"
        >
          Volver Arriba ↑
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Navigation Columns Grid (4 Columns) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 py-12 border-b border-white/[0.06] text-xs">
      <!-- Col 1: Producto -->
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-4">
          Producto & Serie X
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-neutral-400 font-light">
          <li><a href="#overview" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Visión General</a></li>
          <li><a href="#optics" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Óptica FUJINON 23mm</a></li>
          <li><a href="#mechanics" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Control Analógico & Diales</a></li>
          <li><a href="#gallery" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Simulaciones de Película</a></li>
          <li><a href="#specs" class="hover:text-white transition-colors">Especificaciones Técnicas</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 2: Accesorios -->
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-4">
          Accesorios Oficiales
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-neutral-400 font-light">
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Parasol de Lente LH-X100</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Anillo Adaptador AR-X100</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Filtro Protector PRF-49</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Lente de Conversión WCL-X100 II</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Lente Teleconversor TCL-X100 II</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 3: Software & Ecosistema -->
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-4">
          Ecosistema Digital
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-neutral-400 font-light">
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">FUJIFILM XApp (iOS / Android)</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Actualizaciones de Firmware</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">RAW FILE CONVERTER EX 3.0</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">FUJIFILM X RAW STUDIO</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Compatibilidad Frame.io Camera to Cloud</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Col 4: Soporte & Garantía -->
      <div>
        <div class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white mb-4">
          Soporte & Legal
        </div>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5 text-neutral-400 font-light">
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Registro Oficial de Garantía</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Red de Servicio Técnico Autorizado</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Manuales de Usuario PDF</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Comunidad X-Photographers</span></li>
          <li><span class="hover:text-neutral-300">Políticas de Privacidad Global</span></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Bottom Bar: Legal & Engineering Credit -->
    <div class="pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[11px] font-mono text-neutral-400">
      <div>
        © FUJIFILM Corporation. Todos los derechos reservados.
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <span>Diseñado en Japón</span>
        <span>·</span>
        <span>Astro 5 + React 19 + GSAP</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
